{"articleNo":"471886","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=471886&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [프로그래머스] 데브코스 : 데이터 분석","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2024.01.05","hit":"3150","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQRkgvAjgDwE4HUDWBzAUgOwGEArbAWwBsBZABQGMA1YgTwDoAHfbIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">프로그래머스 데브코스 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">데이터 분석 수강생 모집</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">주니어 데이터 분석가 취업을 위한 데이터 분석의 정석을 알려 드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">✅ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">국내외 데이터 팀 채용 자료 분석하여 커리큘럼 제작</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">✅ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">직접 대시보드를 구성하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">분석 결과를 시각화 하는 능력</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">✅ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">기초부터 실전 활용까지 데이터의 깊은 내용까지 이해</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">✅ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">현업 능력과 요구사항 분석 능력을 겸비한 실무형 인재</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">✅ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">발표회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">피어리뷰</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">코어타임 진행하며 학습 능력 향상</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">✅ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지속적인 만족도 조사를 통해 커리큘럼 개선 및 특강 진행</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">✅ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">개의 개인 프로젝트와 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">개의 최종 프로젝트를 통해 나만의 포트폴리오 완성</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">모집 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">📍</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">모집 인원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 60</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">📍</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">모집 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 2023. 12. 20.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) - 2024. 1. 26.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">오후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">시까지</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">📍</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지원 자격</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">공통</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">국민 내일 배움 카드 소지자 및 발급 가능한 분</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">필수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">평소 데이터 분석에 관심이 있고 흥미가 있는 누구나</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">교육 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">📍</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">교육 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US